WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.398 --> 00:00:06.634
Today's Monday Minute is: "Get out of the office!"

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:09.502
I got a great email from my video producer, Christina,

00:00:09.502 --> 00:00:11.268
hey, Christina! (she's watching);

00:00:11.268 --> 00:00:16.414
who reminded me that, you know, if all you need is an internet connection and a laptop, to encourage...

00:00:16.414 --> 00:00:22.591
people to get out of the office. And it's true, you can get stuck in rut, doing the same thing in the same...

00:00:22.591 --> 00:00:27.541
environment and you can shake things up, get new creativity, get new ideas, get new motivation...

00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:30.525
new energy by just getting out of your office!

00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:34.198
If you could work from a laptop, go work in the garden one day.

00:00:34.198 --> 00:00:36.963
If all you need is an internet connection, go to a Starbucks, go to a library.

00:00:36.963 --> 00:00:44.186
Just get out of the office for one day and shake your routine up, just a little bit, to get a little bit more energy,

00:00:44.186 --> 00:00:49.576
because doing the same thing over and over and over and over and over again doesn't lead to creativity...

00:00:49.576 --> 00:00:51.165
or happiness.

00:00:51.165 --> 00:00:55.909
So sometime this week, go and get out of the office and work from somewhere else.

00:00:55.909 --> 00:00:57.046
Believe!

00:00:57.046 --> 00:01:01.098
Like this video. Leave a comment. Click on my face, subscribe to the channel.

00:01:01.098 --> 00:01:02.411
I'll see you soon!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

